text:
It’s a great week in horror!

@garnetonwinter.bsky.social , whose next novel I’m publishing (Cracks in an Ocean of Glass, Spring 27) was nominated for for a Stoker for Silk and Sinew! 
I get to see @sgj.bsky.social tomorrow! A horror author in the Bay Area (we need more horror events here!)

